Elvis Presley or Janet Jackson.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:36.590
FELIPE HOFFA: But
we're getting music.

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:37.130
Music is close enough.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:37.385
DR. ALEXANDRE
PASSANT: Yeah, we're

00:06:37.385 --> 00:06:38.690
still getting
[INAUDIBLE], like music.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:40.690
There with relevant things
like the Sex Pistols,

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.360
the Ramones, which are--
which you can find actually

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:46.420
in a-- in a mus--
in a radio station,

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.550
like if you take a radio
