Pistols or the Ramones.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.210
And we have them here
just because on the web,

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.460
people edited the page.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.586
FELIPE HOFFA: So we're
immediately getting results.

00:06:58.586 --> 00:07:00.668
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT: So
but let's take something

00:07:00.668 --> 00:07:01.660
maybe a bit different.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:06.154
So, what we have
there is [INAUDIBLE].

00:07:06.154 --> 00:07:07.570
Let's take Motorhead
for instance,

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.455
and see if we have
other-- Motorhead.

00:07:10.455 --> 00:07:12.580
FELIPE HOFFA: What artist
now we are going to look?

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.137
What artist are
similar to Motorhead?

00:07:14.137 --> 00:07:14.720
Based on the--

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.320
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT:
Based on the way people--

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.170
FELIPE HOFFA: Of edits.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.378
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT: Edits.

00:07:18.378 --> 00:07:19.820
And we haven't run
that query yet,

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:22.890
