00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.750
FELIPE HOFFA: Excellent.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:25.782
So we're going over--

00:07:25.782 --> 00:07:28.240
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT: Process--
Bit more than 200 million.

00:07:30.597 --> 00:07:31.680
FELIPE HOFFA: It process--

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:32.430
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT:
Seven seconds.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.710
FELIPE HOFFA: Yes, seven
seconds to process [INAUDIBLE].

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:35.190
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT:
That's not too bad.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.980
FELIPE HOFFA: Look
