00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:38.160
And we're getting
[INAUDIBLE] the music.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.868
DR. ALEXANDRE PASSANT:
Yeah Motown music.

00:07:39.868 --> 00:07:42.230
Found out [INAUDIBLE]
Guns and Roses.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:46.410
Things that are not music
